<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h3>Overview</h3>
<p>
    Existing Blazor chart libraries often wrap Javascript libraries, requiring JSInterop and external dependencies.
    <b>BlazorGraphs</b> was built to provide a fully native Blazor experience using only <b>C# and SVG</b>.
</p>
